+ *
+ * <p>This class deliberately owns neither GeckoRuntime nor GeckoSession nor any GeckoView public
+ * extension object. Product code will map its plain immutable values through one private adapter.
+ * Local streams transfer ownership at method entry and are staged on a dedicated I/O executor in
+ * an application-private, no-backup directory before Gecko is allowed to inspect them.
